ublic identifier redacted],\nL21@P0: nominated for the position of member of the Supervisory Board of Holding XS1 S.A., for\nL22@P0: reappointment.\nL23@P0: 4.1 Unanimous favorable opinion and issued Opinion No. 017/2022.\nL24@P0: 5 Evaluation of the nominee Camila de Freitas Aichinger, CPF: [public identifier redacted], nominated\nL25@P0: for the position of member of the Board of Caixa Seguradora S.A., for reappointment.\nL26@P0-1: 5.1 Unanimous favorable opinion and issued Opinion No. 018/2022. #PUBLIC\nL27@P1:  Page 2 of 2\nL28@P1: 6 Evaluation of the nominee Camila de Freitas Aichinger, CPF: [public identifier redacted], nominated\nL29@P1: for the position of member of the Board of CNP Seguros Holding Brasil S.A., for reappointment.\nL30@P1: 6.1 Unanimous favorable opinion and issued Opinion No. 019/2022.\nL31@P1: 7 Evaluation of the nominee Hebert Luiz Gomide Filho, CPF: [public identifier redacted], nominated for\nL32@P1: the position of member of the Board of Caixa Saúde S.A., for reappointment.\nL33@P1: 7.1 Unanimous favorable opinion and issued Opinion No. 020/2022.\nL34@P1: 8 Evaluation of the nominee Matheus de Mendonça Marques, CPF: [public identifier redacted],\nL35@P1: nominated for the position of alternate member of the Fiscal Council of XS3 Seguros S.A., for\nL36@P1: reappointment.\nL37@P1: 8.1 Unanimous favorable opinion and issued Opinion No. 021/2022.\nL38@P1: 9 Evaluation of the nominee Dante Cassiano Viana, CPF: [public identifier redacted], nominated for the\nL39@P1: position of full member of the Fiscal Council of XS6 Assistência S.A.\nL40@P1: 9.1 Unanimous favorable opinion and issued Opinion No. 022/2022.\nL41@P1: With the voting closed on 21/Mar/2022, at 3:30 pm, I, (Rafaela Nascimento Moura\nL42@P1: Cordeiro), designated Secretary, drew up these Minutes, which will be signed by myself and by the\nL43@P1: Committee Members, and will be included in the proper file.\nL44@P1: MARCOS VINÍCIUS E SILVA\nL45@P1: Member\nL46@P1: RAFAEL RIBEIRO DE AGUIAR\nL47@P1: Member\nL48@P1: FABIANA CALVIÑO MARQUES PEREIRA\nL49@P1: Committee Chairman\n"